<title>USA: Ampal-American completes food unit sale.</title>
<headline>Ampal-American completes food unit sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ampal-American Israel Corp said it completed the sale of its equity interest in its food processing unit, Pri Ha'emek 88 Ltd, to Britain's Agrifarm International Ltd.</p>
<p>Terms of the sale were not disclosed. Ampal said it first announced the sale October 11.</p>
<p>Company officials could not be immediately reached to comment.</p>
</text>
